{"name": "One Arrow", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/60bb704adf13e97139f01d14e8c5e476.webp?t=1791410968\" width=\"489\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your arrow to create a platform  wherever you want. Carve your own routes and create shortcuts no one else will take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/8f7101b0ef0eb70787d0c27f51ba8d19.poster.avif?t=1791410968\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/8f7101b0ef0eb70787d0c27f51ba8d19.webm?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/8f7101b0ef0eb70787d0c27f51ba8d19.mp4?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/0497f931ed8a1be23b0c6f3f99749b41.webp?t=1791410968\" width=\"489\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only one arrow, every shot is crucial. Do you use it to block an attack, take out your enemy, or evade them altogether? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/8a2b0e5122c702393b53e3861f036a01.poster.avif?t=1791410968\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/8a2b0e5122c702393b53e3861f036a01.webm?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/8a2b0e5122c702393b53e3861f036a01.mp4?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/b68e1a086bc50fca1262631c43551ddf.webp?t=1791410968\" width=\"489\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level introduces new mechanics, hazards, and twists. Just as you get comfortable, a new obstacle changes the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/cbe409ca9914d7f52d07088e4410b296.poster.avif?t=1791410968\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/cbe409ca9914d7f52d07088e4410b296.webm?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/cbe409ca9914d7f52d07088e4410b296.mp4?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/e2e03c6de396cb1a16a1c4c8f8269f29.webp?t=1791410968\" width=\"489\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss pushes your mechanics further. These pinnacle encounters will force you to think strategically, adapt quickly, and utilize your arrow to its maximum potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/405e6b90663b00b38c0231ac721a421d.poster.avif?t=1791410968\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/405e6b90663b00b38c0231ac721a421d.webm?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/405e6b90663b00b38c0231ac721a421d.mp4?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"45\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/b92d9c8785e70b395d2b15e5a4e0692b.webp?t=1791410968\" width=\"489\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go beyond completion and aim for perfection. Unlock bonus levels and cosmetics by grabbing collectibles and optimizing your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/cd51b5e9deb29dbacd4da35a1c46ac67.poster.avif?t=1791410968\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/cd51b5e9deb29dbacd4da35a1c46ac67.webm?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/extras/cd51b5e9deb29dbacd4da35a1c46ac67.mp4?t=1791410968\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Freeze your arrow in midair and then use it as a platform in this challenging precision platformer. Carve your own paths, outsmart your enemies, and uncover the secrets of your magic arrow.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992340/ce49e8d117fc71d3aeda55f2b00cb0ca5a0c004d/header.jpg?t=1791410968", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Precision Platformer", "Difficult", "Pixel Graphics", "Platformer", "Fast-Paced", "2D Platformer"], "developers": "CoalGames", "publishers": "CoalGames", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3992340", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 October 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JyfuOernDYs", "first_seen": 1791324000.0, "review_rank": 27}